---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Report received" description="Thanks for reporting a scam to Latchkey Daily." noindex hideCrumbs>
  <div class="container-site py-14 md:py-24 max-w-2xl">
    <p class="tag mb-5"><span>Report received</span></p>
    <h1>Thank you. That helps the next person.</h1>
    <p class="text-lg mt-4">We read every report. If it is a new wave, it becomes an alert; if it matches a known scam, it raises that page's report count so readers know it is active.</p>
    <ul class="mt-6">
      <li><a href="/scams/recovery/">If you paid or gave information, do this in the next hour.</a></li>
      <li><a href="/scams/report/">Report it to the FTC and the platform too.</a></li>
      <li><a href="/scams/">Browse the scam database.</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
